## 🌐 HotelAPI APIs Used

### 1. HotelAPI Hotel Search API (REST)
- **Endpoint:** `http://api.tbotechnology.in/HotelAPIHolidays_HotelAPI/Search`
- **Method:** POST (JSON)
- **Auth:** HTTP Basic (username + password)
- **Purpose:** Search available hotels by city code, dates, guests
- **Returns:** Hotel results with room rates, meal types, refund policy

### 2. HotelAPI Hotel Code List API (REST)
- **Endpoint:** `http://api.tbotechnology.in/HotelAPIHolidays_HotelAPI/HotelAPIHotelCodeList`
- **Method:** POST (JSON)
- **Purpose:** Fetch hotel metadata — images, facilities, star ratings, descriptions
- **Returns:** Hotel details, addresses, amenities, photos per hotel

### 3. HotelAPI Air Search API (REST)
- **Endpoint:** `http://SharedServices.tbotechnology.in/SharedData.svc/rest/Authenticate`
- **Method:** POST → returns TokenId
- **Endpoint:** `http://api.tektravels.com/BookingEngineService_Air/AirService.svc/rest/Search`
- **Method:** POST (JSON with TokenId)
- **Purpose:** Search round-trip flights (outbound + return)
- **Returns:** Flight options with airlines, times, fares, baggage info, segments

