## 🧠 Custom Algorithms & Engine

### Multi-Vector Preference Scoring
- **Cosine similarity** matching across 3 vectors:
  - **Vibe Vector** (60% weight) — Nature, Culture, Adventure, Romance, etc.
  - **Activity Vector** (25% weight) — Hiking, Food, Photography, Spa, etc.
  - **Stay Vector** (15% weight) — Boutique, Resort, Eco, Luxury, etc.
- **Budget alignment** bonus/penalty based on cost bracket
- **Profile tag overlap** bonus for curated preferences
- Scores normalized to 55–99% match range

### Smart Card Selection
- Weighted random selection from 66 swipe cards (22 vibes, 26 activities, 18 stays)
- Avoids repeats, balances card categories
- ELO-style scoring from swipe-left/right actions

### Geocoder / Airport Resolver
- Maps 30+ Indian cities to IATA airport codes
- Haversine distance calculation for nearest hub
- Multi-leg routing: `UserCity → Nearest Hub → Destination`

---

## 🔌 Backend API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/session` | Create planning session |
| `GET` | `/api/session/:id` | Get session data + preferences |
| `PATCH` | `/api/session/:id/link-email` | Link session to authenticated user |
| `GET` | `/api/session/by-email/:email` | Get returning user's session |
| `GET` | `/api/cards` | Get swipe cards (vibes, activities, stays) |
| `POST` | `/api/swipe` | Record swipe + update preference vectors |
| `POST` | `/api/destinations/shortlist` | Generate ranked destination shortlist |
| `POST` | `/api/destinations/itinerary/generate` | Generate full itinerary with live HotelAPI data |
| `POST` | `/api/preferences/calibrate` | Fine-tune preferences via profile tags |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/register` | User registration |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | User login |

