## 🚀 Deployment & Infrastructure

| Service | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Vercel** | Frontend hosting (Next.js, auto-deploy from GitHub) |
| **Railway / Render** | Backend hosting (Node.js Express server) |
| **MongoDB Atlas** | Cloud database (free M0 cluster) |
| **Google Cloud** | OAuth 2.0 credentials for sign-in |
| **GitHub** | Source control & CI/CD |

---

## 📦 Database Models (MongoDB)

| Collection | Key Fields |
|---|---|
| **Session** | departureCity, duration, travelers, budget, vibeScores, activityScores, stayScores, swipeEvents, profileTags, savedItinerary, savedShortlist, userEmail |
| **Destination** | destinationId, name, country, vibeVector, activityVector, stayVector, flights, hotel, days, transfers, breakdown |
| **Card** | cardId, text, category (vibe/activity/stay), image, vibeWeights |
| **User** | email, passwordHash, name |
